.TH MYGREP 3 "September 2026" "Version 0.3.1" "MyUtils Library Manual"
.SH NAME
mygrep \- search a file for lines matching a pattern
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <myfilefunctions.h>
.sp
.BI "int mygrep(const char *" filename ", const char *" pattern ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mygrep()
function searches the file specified by
.I filename
for lines containing the substring
.I pattern
and prints each matching line to standard output.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of matching lines found, or -1 if the file cannot be opened.
